---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
import SectionTitle from "./SectionTitle.astro";
---

<Section id="about" class="capabilities-section">
	<div class="section-heading section-heading--split">
		<div>
			<p class="eyebrow">
				<span></span> What I bring
			</p>
			<SectionTitle>Product-minded engineering, end to end.</SectionTitle>
		</div>
		<p>
			I connect architecture, delivery, and user experience—so the software works as one coherent
			system, not a collection of hand-offs.
		</p>
	</div>
	<ol class="capability-list">
		<li>
			<span class="capability-list__number">01</span>
			<h3>Backend systems</h3>
			<p>Domain-focused APIs and services using C#, .NET, Node.js, PostgreSQL, and SQL Server.</p>
		</li>
		<li>
			<span class="capability-list__number">02</span>
			<h3>Product interfaces</h3>
			<p>Accessible, maintainable web experiences with TypeScript, React, Vue, and Blazor.</p>
		</li>
		<li>
			<span class="capability-list__number">03</span>
			<h3>Cloud delivery</h3>
			<p>Reliable paths to production using AWS, Azure, Docker, and GitHub Actions.</p>
		</li>
	</ol>
</Section>
